sequenceDiagram
    actor Guest
    participant Booking

    Guest->>Booking: leave_review(rating, comment)
    Note over Booking: Check caller owns booking, status is confirmed,<br/>stay has ended, no previous review,<br/>and rating is valid

    alt Review is allowed
        create participant Review
        Booking->>Review: Create review
        Note over Review: Store rating and comment
        Note over Booking: Associate review with this booking
        Review-->>Booking: new review
        Booking-->>Guest: review submitted
    else Review is not allowed
        Booking-->>Guest: review rejected
    end
